-- Section 100 — World War 2 Grade 7 Expansion Sprint
-- Closes the largest content gap found by Section 99 Inventory Audit:
-- Grade 7 had 0 accessible world_war_2 questions.
--
-- 25 questions: target_grade=7, domain=world_war_2, is_active=true
-- Band distribution: B1×6, B2×7, B3×7, B4×5
--
-- Topic coverage: Rise of Nazism, Hitler, Holocaust, Danish occupation,
-- resistance, rescue of Danish Jews, D-Day, liberation, human rights.
